% A query that fails in evaluation is reported and the session goes on to
% the next line, whether the query was typed alone or under .plan, which
% shows the plan it made before failing.  The two facts and a limit of four
% tuples leave no room for p(X)?, which reads p completely, deriving two
% tuples, and whose answer would hold two more, and room for the answers of
% e(1)? and e(X)?.  The session, and the run, then exit 1.
e(1).
e(2).
p(X) :- e(X).
